+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mActually, let's re-check: target is [true, true, false, true].[39m                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  Press button 2: toggles [0, 3] → [on, off, off, on][39m                                                                                                                                                                     [49m
