+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Part 2: Counter Puzzle[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mA variant where lights are replaced by **counters**. Each counter starts at 0. Buttons **increment** (not toggle) specific counters by 1. Counters wrap around at a given modulus (e.g., mod 5 means values cycle [39m        [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m0→1→2→3→4→0).[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mEach button can be pressed **multiple times** (0 to modulus-1 times).[39m                                                                                                                                                     [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```typescript[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mfunction solveCounter([39m                                                                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  lights: number[],      // target counter values (each 0..modulus-1)[39m                                                                                                                                                     [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  buttons: number[][],   // buttons[i] = indices of counters affected[39m                                                                                                                                                     [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  modulus: number        // counters wrap at this value (always prime)[39m                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m): number[] | null;[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Return an array where `result[i]` is the number of times button `i` should be pressed (0 to modulus-1).[39m                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- If multiple solutions exist, return the one with the **minimum total presses** (sum of all result values).[39m                                                                                                              [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- If tied on total, return the **lexicographically smallest** result array.[39m                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Return `null` if no solution exists.[39m                                                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- The modulus is always a **prime number**.[39m                                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m**Constraint**: Must handle up to 40 buttons, 40 counters, and modulus up to 97. Must complete in under 5 seconds.[39m                                                                                                        [49m
